### Habit API scenario: the book (Raf) and the water counter (Sayac).
### Run the requests top to bottom (VS Code REST Client or Rider HTTP Client).
### Fill the two seed account values from user-secrets: Seed:SahipEmail / Seed:SahipPassword
### (and Seed:AsistanEmail / Seed:AsistanPassword for the 403 example). Do not commit real values.

@host = http://localhost:5071
@sahipEmail = <Seed:SahipEmail>
@sahipSifre = <Seed:SahipPassword>
@asistanEmail = <Seed:AsistanEmail>
@asistanSifre = <Seed:AsistanPassword>

# Client-made ids (Guid v7 style), so every POST below can be repeated safely.
@kitapAliskanlikId = 019e0000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001
@kitapId = 019e0000-0000-7000-8000-000000000002
@oturum1Id = 019e0000-0000-7000-8000-000000000003
@oturum2Id = 019e0000-0000-7000-8000-000000000004
@suAliskanlikId = 019e0000-0000-7000-8000-000000000005
# Habit day (05:00 Istanbul rule). Change it to today's habit day.
@bugun = 2026-10-31

### 1. Log in as Sahip
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/hesap/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{sahipEmail}}", "password": "{{sahipSifre}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1b. Who am I -> { id, email, roller, izinler } (the mobile app reads the role from here)
GET {{host}}/api/ben
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Create the Raf habit "Kitap okuma" -> 201 (again with the same id -> 200)
POST {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{kitapAliskanlikId}}",
  "ad": "Kitap okuma",
  "tur": "raf",
  "ikon": "book-open",
  "renk": "violet",
  "olcu": "sayili",
  "hedefYonu": "enAz",
  "gunlukHedef": 30,
  "birim": "sayfa",
  "ogeEtiketi": "Kitap",
  "altBaslikEtiketi": "Yazar",
  "siklik": "herGun"
}

### 3. Add the book, starting at page 12 -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar/{{kitapAliskanlikId}}/ogeler
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{kitapId}}",
  "ad": "Kürk Mantolu Madonna",
  "altBaslik": "Sabahattin Ali",
  "toplam": 160,
  "baslangicKonumu": 12,
  "durum": "devam"
}

### 4. "I got to page 35" -> 201, miktar 23 (start = the item's start, 12)
POST {{host}}/api/ogeler/{{kitapId}}/oturumlar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "{{oturum1Id}}", "bitisKonum": 35, "dakika": 40 }

### 4b. Same session id again -> 200, nothing is written twice
POST {{host}}/api/ogeler/{{kitapId}}/oturumlar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "{{oturum1Id}}", "bitisKonum": 35, "dakika": 40 }

### 5. The item: guncelKonum 35, ilerleme 0.22, hiz and tahminiBitis filled
GET {{host}}/api/ogeler/{{kitapId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. The "Today" screen: bugun (miktar 23, deger 0.77), guc, seri, devamEdenler
GET {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Days of the last 30 days (empty days come with 0)
GET {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar/{{kitapAliskanlikId}}/gunler
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Sessions, newest first (the first one has "son": true)
GET {{host}}/api/ogeler/{{kitapId}}/oturumlar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Create the Sayac habit "Su iç" (8 glasses) -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{suAliskanlikId}}",
  "ad": "Su iç",
  "tur": "sayac",
  "ikon": "droplet",
  "renk": "blue",
  "olcu": "sayili",
  "hedefYonu": "enAz",
  "gunlukHedef": 8,
  "birim": "bardak",
  "siklik": "herGun"
}

### 10. Write the day's total (not an increment); repeating it changes nothing -> 200
### Quantities are decimals: 1.5 and 50.0 are valid.
PUT {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar/{{suAliskanlikId}}/kayitlar/{{bugun}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "miktar": 6.5 }

### 11. Photo upload -> 201 { id, url }. Put a jpg/png/webp next to this file as kapak.jpg first.
POST {{host}}/api/dosyalar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sinir

--sinir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="dosya"; filename="kapak.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./kapak.jpg
--sinir--

### 12. Read the photo back (use the id from step 11)
GET {{host}}/api/dosyalar/<dosya-id>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- Error examples ----------------

### E0. 400: malformed JSON -> ProblemDetails (no exception page)
POST {{host}}/api/ogeler/{{kitapId}}/oturumlar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bitisKonum":

### E1. 400: empty name -> errors: { ad: [...] } (camelCase keys, like the JSON field names)
POST {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ad": "", "tur": "raf", "ikon": "book-open", "renk": "violet", "olcu": "evetHayir" }

### E1b. 400: a Raf habit that is yes/no -> errors: { olcu: [...], ogeEtiketi: [...] }
POST {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ad": "Kitap", "tur": "raf", "ikon": "book-open", "renk": "violet", "olcu": "evetHayir" }

### E2. 400: end position not after the start (the item is at 35) -> errors: { bitisKonum: [...] }
POST {{host}}/api/ogeler/{{kitapId}}/oturumlar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bitisKonum": 30 }

### E3. 401: no token
GET {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar

### E4. 403: log in as Asistan (no izin claim) and read
# @name asistanLogin
POST {{host}}/api/hesap/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{asistanEmail}}", "password": "{{asistanSifre}}" }

###
GET {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar
Authorization: Bearer {{asistanLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### E5. 409: add a second session, then try to change the first one (only the last one can change)
POST {{host}}/api/ogeler/{{kitapId}}/oturumlar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "{{oturum2Id}}", "bitisKonum": 50, "baslangicKonum": 35 }

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/oturumlar/{{oturum1Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### E6. 409: offline start position that does not match the server's (server says 50)
POST {{host}}/api/ogeler/{{kitapId}}/oturumlar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bitisKonum": 60, "baslangicKonum": 40 }

### E7. 409: a daily entry for a Raf habit
PUT {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar/{{kitapAliskanlikId}}/kayitlar/{{bugun}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "miktar": 10 }

### Clean up: deleting a habit removes its items, sessions and photos
DELETE {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar/{{kitapAliskanlikId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/aliskanliklar/{{suAliskanlikId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
